    "Akun dan semua datamu dihapus permanen, lalu kamu kembali ke awal. Tidak bisa dibatalkan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account and all data are deleted permanently, and you start over. This can't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Akun tamu hanya ada di iPhone ini. Jika keluar atau app dihapus, datanya tidak bisa dibuka lagi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A guest account lives only on this iPhone. If you sign out or delete the app, its data can't be opened again."
